from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"), colors (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), opacities (from "},{"code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and dimensions (from "},{"code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}],"title":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider/dimensions":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of dimension semantic tokens to use for list item dimensions"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/dimensions","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider\/dimensions","role":"symbol","title":"dimensions","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dimensions"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract34AllDimensionSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider